<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 8.225 pct at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 8.225 pct at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday its offer of NZ$100 million of February 2001 bonds yielded an average 8.225 percent.</p>
<p>In a previous tender on February 27, $100 million of the same bonds yielded an average 7.640 percent.</p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$687 million in Thursday's tender and the successful bids ranged from 8.22 to 8.23 percent.</p>
<p>The bonds have an eight percent coupon, and the settlement date is on April 15.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
</text>
